(910387, 105237, 24528, '<td valign="top">Who said white man cant jump? I Beg the differ.. Love the Air Jordan Sneaker... Sike..Nice picture</td>', 'Who said white man cant jump? I Beg the differ.. Love the Air Jordan Sneaker... Sike..Nice picture', '2004-09-15 01:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(910392, 105344, 24511, '<td valign="top">Tough one.  Do I look up and catch the ball or look down to break my fall?  There always seems to be an element of risk in contact sports.  The balance between dilema and determination can mean failure vs success.  For the wisdom of landing on ones feet must sometimes take flight to risking the moment to chance fate.  Clearly a story telling photo.  Thanks.</td>', 'Tough one.  Do I look up and catch the ball or look down to break my fall?  There always seems to be an element of risk in contact sports.  The balance between dilema and determination can mean failure vs success.  For the wisdom of landing on ones feet must sometimes take flight to risking the moment to chance fate.  Clearly a story telling photo.  Thanks.', '2004-09-15 01:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
