(910408, 105401, 18677, '<td valign="top">Aggie football?  How embarrassing!  I don''t think the aggies quite qualify for an "action" shot.  I think you would''ve been better off submitting one from the previous week to the "smoke" challenge, as the aggies were thoroughly smoked by Utah.  Maybe if you''re lucky there might be a "hopeless" challenge during the week of Nov. 6.  Then a picture of aggie football should win you a ribbon.  ;-)<br/> <br/>Anyway, a good picture of a horrible team is still a good picture, and this is a good picture... 7<br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Aggie football?  How embarrassing!  I don''t think the aggies quite qualify for an "action" shot.  I think you would''ve been better off submitting one from the previous week to the "smoke" challenge, as the aggies were thoroughly smoked by Utah.  Maybe if you''re lucky there might be a "hopeless" challenge during the week of Nov. 6.  Then a picture of aggie football should win you a ribbon.  ;-) Anyway, a good picture of a horrible team is still a good picture, and this is a good picture... 7  ', '2004-09-15 01:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
