(910789, 104730, 21031, '<td valign="top">Swimming... a team sport? :) just kidding. the best damn photo in this challenge. you really can feel how hard he''s trying. -10</td>', 'Swimming... a team sport? :) just kidding. the best damn photo in this challenge. you really can feel how hard he''s trying. -10', '2004-09-15 04:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
