(910796, 105446, 21031, '<td valign="top">WOW! I wish I had taken it! Would''ve been perfect if you could have placed his foot in the frame. But, he is fast. :)-9</td>', 'WOW! I wish I had taken it! Would''ve been perfect if you could have placed his foot in the frame. But, he is fast. :)-9', '2004-09-15 05:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
