(910969, 104518, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice action shot and great for this challenge. It seems like it would be better with a bit more contrast to give the subject more depth and texture. Still, it''s great that you were able to capture this shot.</td>', 'This is a really nice action shot and great for this challenge. It seems like it would be better with a bit more contrast to give the subject more depth and texture. Still, it''s great that you were able to capture this shot.', '2004-09-15 07:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
