(911001, 105473, 19952, '<td valign="top">I really like the motion blur, but think it would be more effective if the background were not in motion and also if it were a bit more level. At that distance, I guess the only way to do that is with a tripod. Still, this is a nice action shot.</td>', 'I really like the motion blur, but think it would be more effective if the background were not in motion and also if it were a bit more level. At that distance, I guess the only way to do that is with a tripod. Still, this is a nice action shot.', '2004-09-15 07:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(911002, 105478, 669, '<td valign="top">I think I''ve seen this before, on Sports Shooter..  Is this Jeff??<br/> <br/>Anyway, great shot.  In honesty, for DPC, they really go for ultra-sharpness, which may hurt your score a little..  Good luck.</td>', 'I think I''ve seen this before, on Sports Shooter..  Is this Jeff?? Anyway, great shot.  In honesty, for DPC, they really go for ultra-sharpness, which may hurt your score a little..  Good luck.', '2004-09-15 07:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(911005, 104730, 669, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture.  Not sure about the sepia, think I might prefer colour, although it does work well.</td>', 'Fantastic capture.  Not sure about the sepia, think I might prefer colour, although it does work well.', '2004-09-15 07:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(911008, 104858, 17551, '<td valign="top">nicely done, high key affect works well here</td>', 'nicely done, high key affect works well here', '2004-09-15 07:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(911010, 104757, 669, '<td valign="top">Nice reasonably clean background, which helps a lot.  Good experssions and freeze frame.  Think I''d maybe have tried to get more kids in the shot?  Still, good work.</td>', 'Nice reasonably clean background, which helps a lot.  Good experssions and freeze frame.  Think I''d maybe have tried to get more kids in the shot?  Still, good work.', '2004-09-15 07:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(911011, 104529, 17551, '<td valign="top">on of the best soccer ones.. clear, sharp and great capture of movement</td>', 'on of the best soccer ones.. clear, sharp and great capture of movement', '2004-09-15 07:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(911013, 104937, 669, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if flying is technically a team sport, but nice use of negative space..</td>', 'I''m not sure if flying is technically a team sport, but nice use of negative space..', '2004-09-15 07:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(911015, 104938, 669, '<td valign="top">Nice freeze frame, but there''s a LOT of distracting elements in the background.  It would be interesting for a news story maybe, but the team sport isn''t really brought into my mind primarly.</td>', 'Nice freeze frame, but there''s a LOT of distracting elements in the background.  It would be interesting for a news story maybe, but the team sport isn''t really brought into my mind primarly.', '2004-09-15 07:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(911019, 104848, 669, '<td valign="top">Excellent work.  Nice lighting, composition and freezeframe.  Water looks a little bit drab, so I might have tried a little Hue/Sat increase.  Otherwise excellent.</td>', 'Excellent work.  Nice lighting, composition and freezeframe.  Water looks a little bit drab, so I might have tried a little Hue/Sat increase.  Otherwise excellent.', '2004-09-15 07:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(911023, 105442, 25355, '<td valign="top">too small and the players are blurred (and one''s chopped off)</td>', 'too small and the players are blurred (and one''s chopped off)', '2004-09-15 07:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(911025, 104777, 669, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the action, although the unhorizontal background is a little distracting.  You were shooting (at least for this shot) 90 degrees from the sun''s direction.  I''d have been tempted to shoot another 45 degrees to the left (possibly the corner of the pitch?) or with the sun behind me.  This would have brightened up the faces, left less shadows on the players, and also shown some interesting player shadows on the pitch you could have captured in your composition.  Overall, good effort.</td>', 'Nice capture of the action, although the unhorizontal background is a little distracting.  You were shooting (at least for this shot) 90 degrees from the sun''s direction.  I''d have been tempted to shoot another 45 degrees to the left (possibly the corner of the pitch?) or with the sun behind me.  This would have brightened up the faces, left less shadows on the players, and also shown some interesting player shadows on the pitch you could have captured in your composition.  Overall, good effort.', '2004-09-15 07:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(911026, 105446, 25355, '<td valign="top">wow, he must be holding that ball really tight, by the look of his arm muscles</td>', 'wow, he must be holding that ball really tight, by the look of his arm muscles', '2004-09-15 07:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(911028, 105123, 25355, '<td valign="top">red ball at top very distracting</td>', 'red ball at top very distracting', '2004-09-15 07:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(911029, 104650, 669, '<td valign="top">Interesting expression and activity..  The clothes look a little over-exposed.  I''d have tried to underexpose just a little bit to keep the whites from blooming.</td>', 'Interesting expression and activity..  The clothes look a little over-exposed.  I''d have tried to underexpose just a little bit to keep the whites from blooming.', '2004-09-15 08:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(911032, 105438, 669, '<td valign="top">That looks like a melee.  Nice sharp shot, although it''s a little busy for my liking.  I''d have tried to zoom in more on the action, if possible.  Still, it''s a very clean crop and nicely composed as it is.  Good work.</td>', 'That looks like a melee.  Nice sharp shot, although it''s a little busy for my liking.  I''d have tried to zoom in more on the action, if possible.  Still, it''s a very clean crop and nicely composed as it is.  Good work.', '2004-09-15 08:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(911033, 104410, 19952, '<td valign="top">Nice rich colors and excellent contrast. It''s great that we can see the action and the players'' faces. Very good shot.</td>', 'Nice rich colors and excellent contrast. It''s great that we can see the action and the players'' faces. Very good shot.', '2004-09-15 08:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(911034, 105195, 26246, '<td valign="top">Go Sampdoria!<br/>Nice shot, just a little too small.<br/>Would have been nice if opponent squad had fair play during the game too.</td>', 'Go Sampdoria!Nice shot, just a little too small.Would have been nice if opponent squad had fair play during the game too.', '2004-09-15 08:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(911038, 104937, 25355, '<td valign="top">nice picture, but what''s the sport?</td>', 'nice picture, but what''s the sport?', '2004-09-15 08:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(911039, 105256, 17551, '<td valign="top">heh i do like this one</td>', 'heh i do like this one', '2004-09-15 08:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(911040, 104929, 669, '<td valign="top">Novel sport to use.  I''d have tried to crop or zoom in much tighter, trying to get some expressions of the competitors.... unless this was a candid, of course!  As it is, I''d have cropped the sand and sky off, making it more of a square image I think.  Also, a very minor thing - the left-hand sail is a little blown out, which it''s worth being careful of on sunny days with very white reflecting things.  Good effort.</td>', 'Novel sport to use.  I''d have tried to crop or zoom in much tighter, trying to get some expressions of the competitors.... unless this was a candid, of course!  As it is, I''d have cropped the sand and sky off, making it more of a square image I think.  Also, a very minor thing - the left-hand sail is a little blown out, which it''s worth being careful of on sunny days with very white reflecting things.  Good effort.', '2004-09-15 08:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(911042, 104491, 669, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and cropping.  Nice sharp image and good capture of the action.  Not too keen on very wide angle shots myself, but otherwise, great work.</td>', 'Excellent composition and cropping.  Nice sharp image and good capture of the action.  Not too keen on very wide angle shots myself, but otherwise, great work.', '2004-09-15 08:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(911043, 105257, 19952, '<td valign="top">Really nice action shot and a great job freezing the motion. Very nice shot.</td>', 'Really nice action shot and a great job freezing the motion. Very nice shot.', '2004-09-15 08:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(911045, 105471, 24969, '<td valign="top">My favorite place in the whole wide world...the shot is a little dark ( I have a bunch like it from my trip in June- it''s hard to get a good balance when the sun is bright and you''re under the deck ) Sneak down closer next time, if you can get through the crowd!</td>', 'My favorite place in the whole wide world...the shot is a little dark ( I have a bunch like it from my trip in June- it''s hard to get a good balance when the sun is bright and you''re under the deck ) Sneak down closer next time, if you can get through the crowd!', '2004-09-15 08:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(911046, 105297, 669, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of shot, but I would have cropped much tigher, which I think would have given pretty much the same effect.</td>', 'Nice choice of shot, but I would have cropped much tigher, which I think would have given pretty much the same effect.', '2004-09-15 08:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(911049, 105480, 669, '<td valign="top">Almost perfect focus and DOF.  Nice choice of sepia too, I think it adds a lot to the shot.  Good composition too.</td>', 'Almost perfect focus and DOF.  Nice choice of sepia too, I think it adds a lot to the shot.  Good composition too.', '2004-09-15 08:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(911050, 104935, 17551, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2004-09-15 08:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(911054, 105235, 669, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the composition.  I think I''d have tried to keep the whole sail in if possible.  Composition must have been very hard work with background objects, so I can see why you chose to include them, but I''d have tried to reduce the number of distractions as much as possible.</td>', 'Not sure about the composition.  I think I''d have tried to keep the whole sail in if possible.  Composition must have been very hard work with background objects, so I can see why you chose to include them, but I''d have tried to reduce the number of distractions as much as possible.', '2004-09-15 08:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(911057, 104935, 19952, '<td valign="top">Thisis my favorite shot of the challenge so far. You did a great job freezing the motion and you captured great action and expressions. Great job.</td>', 'Thisis my favorite shot of the challenge so far. You did a great job freezing the motion and you captured great action and expressions. Great job.', '2004-09-15 08:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(911058, 104630, 25355, '<td valign="top">I detest any rugby, but this is a good capture of a moment.</td>', 'I detest any rugby, but this is a good capture of a moment.', '2004-09-15 08:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(911059, 105473, 669, '<td valign="top">You''ve certainly captured motion, but I''d say it''s very difficult to use a slow shutter on a game of football, just due to changes in direction.  The contrast on the shot seems a bit low.  I think I''d have tried auto-levels or auto-contrast to try and bring out the green a little brighter as well as other elements of the shot.  Good try.</td>', 'You''ve certainly captured motion, but I''d say it''s very difficult to use a slow shutter on a game of football, just due to changes in direction.  The contrast on the shot seems a bit low.  I think I''d have tried auto-levels or auto-contrast to try and bring out the green a little brighter as well as other elements of the shot.  Good try.', '2004-09-15 08:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(911062, 105239, 669, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space here.  Very different shot.  I think I''d have tried a square composition, which would have made the players larger in the frame.  Otherwise, nice work.</td>', 'Nice use of negative space here.  Very different shot.  I think I''d have tried a square composition, which would have made the players larger in the frame.  Otherwise, nice work.', '2004-09-15 08:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(911063, 104522, 25355, '<td valign="top">Is the ball in motion? It looks like it''s resting inside the square. Good shot, anyway.</td>', 'Is the ball in motion? It looks like it''s resting inside the square. Good shot, anyway.', '2004-09-15 08:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(911064, 105475, 669, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and composition.  The image looks a little flat though.  Think I''d have tried to use auto-levels or auto-contrast I think to bump up the colours.</td>', 'Nice contrast and composition.  The image looks a little flat though.  Think I''d have tried to use auto-levels or auto-contrast I think to bump up the colours.', '2004-09-15 08:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(911065, 105031, 25355, '<td valign="top">What is it? A bit of biffo?</td>', 'What is it? A bit of biffo?', '2004-09-15 08:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(911068, 105198, 669, '<td valign="top">Nice crop, although I''d have cropped out a little on the RHS?  A lot of sports shooting is about choosing your position.  You''ve made a good effort here, but you would have had a really excellent shot had you been in front of the players not behind them.</td>', 'Nice crop, although I''d have cropped out a little on the RHS?  A lot of sports shooting is about choosing your position.  You''ve made a good effort here, but you would have had a really excellent shot had you been in front of the players not behind them.', '2004-09-15 08:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(911071, 105447, 669, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  Depending on the quality of your original, I think I''ve have cropped much tighter - just leaning in players 8, 70 and 99.  Good effort.</td>', 'Nice capture.  Depending on the quality of your original, I think I''ve have cropped much tighter - just leaning in players 8, 70 and 99.  Good effort.', '2004-09-15 08:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(911100, 104827, 19952, '<td valign="top">What a great capture! It''s amazing that you were able to get that action with the shadow. Very nice job.</td>', 'What a great capture! It''s amazing that you were able to get that action with the shadow. Very nice job.', '2004-09-15 08:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(911112, 104730, 25655, '<td valign="top">Amazing photo! but not quite team sport... Gave you a 9 ''cause I really loved it though</td>', 'Amazing photo! but not quite team sport... Gave you a 9 ''cause I really loved it though', '2004-09-15 08:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(911123, 104557, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot for this challenge, but I think it would be better either fully desaturated or all in color. Regardless, it''s a good action photo.</td>', 'This is a nice shot for this challenge, but I think it would be better either fully desaturated or all in color. Regardless, it''s a good action photo.', '2004-09-15 09:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(911128, 104887, 19952, '<td valign="top">That''s a very intimidating sea of blue and gold. This is the only shot I''ve seen with everyone facing away from the camera that I actually like. It''s a very nice capture and a well composed shot. Good job.</td>', 'That''s a very intimidating sea of blue and gold. This is the only shot I''ve seen with everyone facing away from the camera that I actually like. It''s a very nice capture and a well composed shot. Good job.', '2004-09-15 09:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(911129, 105442, 14202, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little bigger would have helped... ;)</td>', 'Maybe a little bigger would have helped... ;)', '2004-09-15 09:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(911132, 105186, 24925, '<td valign="top">Title makes me wonder.  Decent photo...</td>', 'Title makes me wonder.  Decent photo...', '2004-09-15 09:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(911134, 105447, 19952, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot of the quarterback in the pocket. The colors are bright and it''s great that we can see such expression in the lineman''s face. Very good job.</td>', 'Nice action shot of the quarterback in the pocket. The colors are bright and it''s great that we can see such expression in the lineman''s face. Very good job.', '2004-09-15 09:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(911135, 104835, 14202, '<td valign="top">IMHO maybe a little closer with the cropping...great shot tho.</td>', 'IMHO maybe a little closer with the cropping...great shot tho.', '2004-09-15 09:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(911155, 105191, 669, '<td valign="top">Nice try with the nice tight composition.  Also nice expression.  The image seems a little soft, possibly because you used a DOF a little too shallow.  I think I''d have tried auto-levels or contrast to bring out the colours a little more.  All in all, great work.</td>', 'Nice try with the nice tight composition.  Also nice expression.  The image seems a little soft, possibly because you used a DOF a little too shallow.  I think I''d have tried auto-levels or contrast to bring out the colours a little more.  All in all, great work.', '2004-09-15 09:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(911157, 105320, 669, '<td valign="top">I hope this doesn''t get marked down for not being a team sport, because it definitely is.  Composition is a little wide for me.  I think I''d have cropped either tight on the first car or in the backwards ''c'' but with a LOT less around the edge.  All in all, good effort.</td>', 'I hope this doesn''t get marked down for not being a team sport, because it definitely is.  Composition is a little wide for me.  I think I''d have cropped either tight on the first car or in the backwards ''c'' but with a LOT less around the edge.  All in all, good effort.', '2004-09-15 09:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(911159, 104639, 669, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF here - I like the graduation on the grass at the bottom.  Looks a tad wide, I think.  I''d have cropped a lot off the left and a little off the right, assuming your original image was large enough.  You''ve got some over-exposure on the white players, which you want to watch out for on bright days outdoors.  I always under-expose a little to make sure I don''t blow out whites (which is reeally easy).  Overall interesting shot with a pleasant background.  I think you''d get a lot more of a ''sheen'' if the shot was tighter.<br/> <br/>Just thinking actually I may even have cropped out the whiteplayer on the right and cropped very tight on the orange/black player (9?).  That would have made it a much tigher shot, and also got rid of the most obvious over-exposure.</td>', 'Nice DOF here - I like the graduation on the grass at the bottom.  Looks a tad wide, I think.  I''d have cropped a lot off the left and a little off the right, assuming your original image was large enough.  You''ve got some over-exposure on the white players, which you want to watch out for on bright days outdoors.  I always under-expose a little to make sure I don''t blow out whites (which is reeally easy).  Overall interesting shot with a pleasant background.  I think you''d get a lot more of a ''sheen'' if the shot was tighter. Just thinking actually I may even have cropped out the whiteplayer on the right and cropped very tight on the orange/black player (9?).  That would have made it a much tigher shot, and also got rid of the most obvious over-exposure.', '2004-09-15 09:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(911161, 104388, 669, '<td valign="top">Excellent angle and composition.  At that distance you''re not going to get a tight shot, so you did well to work with what you had and come out with a nice shot.  One thing - it''s very dark.  Using auto-levels or contrast should bump up the colours nicely producing a more vibrant shot.  Good effort.</td>', 'Excellent angle and composition.  At that distance you''re not going to get a tight shot, so you did well to work with what you had and come out with a nice shot.  One thing - it''s very dark.  Using auto-levels or contrast should bump up the colours nicely producing a more vibrant shot.  Good effort.', '2004-09-15 09:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(911164, 104518, 669, '<td valign="top">Fantastic expression - made me laugh out loud. :-)  I''m not sure I''d have gone for b&amp;w.  As you did, it''s looking ok, but the image seems fairly flat to me.  I''d have tried to increase contrast/levels to bump it up a bit.  Excellent capture too - you caught the action nicely.</td>', 'Fantastic expression - made me laugh out loud. :-)  I''m not sure I''d have gone for b&w.  As you did, it''s looking ok, but the image seems fairly flat to me.  I''d have tried to increase contrast/levels to bump it up a bit.  Excellent capture too - you caught the action nicely.', '2004-09-15 09:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(911166, 104822, 669, '<td valign="top">I see where you''re coming from with the city in the background, but I''m not keen on the overall feel of the image.  It''s hard to make out the foreground and because the skyline is fairly detailed the image seems quite cluttered.  Good effort to go for what you did, but I think it needs a little refinement.</td>', 'I see where you''re coming from with the city in the background, but I''m not keen on the overall feel of the image.  It''s hard to make out the foreground and because the skyline is fairly detailed the image seems quite cluttered.  Good effort to go for what you did, but I think it needs a little refinement.', '2004-09-15 09:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(911174, 105184, 25143, '<td valign="top">I find the colors too much , the angle of view is very amusing</td>', 'I find the colors too much , the angle of view is very amusing', '2004-09-15 09:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
