(911294, 105485, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the effect here of placing a jersey on top of a picture in this nostalgic image of the US national pastime.  It has an oddly three dimensional feel to it.  I think the framing could be improved here to include the complete body of Jackie Robinson (the runner) and also including more of the team name. Also, I think the sepia effect here is a bit weak and nees more imapct.</td>', 'I like the effect here of placing a jersey on top of a picture in this nostalgic image of the US national pastime.  It has an oddly three dimensional feel to it.  I think the framing could be improved here to include the complete body of Jackie Robinson (the runner) and also including more of the team name. Also, I think the sepia effect here is a bit weak and nees more imapct.', '2004-09-15 11:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(911302, 105256, 5822, '<td valign="top">This is a very good action shot with good tones, although a bit dark. The sign in the background is distracting and I think your shot would have more impact if you were able to blur the background and isloate the players.  I really like the expression on these players faces. Well done.</td>', 'This is a very good action shot with good tones, although a bit dark. The sign in the background is distracting and I think your shot would have more impact if you were able to blur the background and isloate the players.  I really like the expression on these players faces. Well done.', '2004-09-15 11:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(911305, 105442, 10634, '<td valign="top">This would be excellent if it were larger... 6</td>', 'This would be excellent if it were larger... 6', '2004-09-15 11:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(911308, 104741, 25483, '<td valign="top">OK..... so just what do you expect to get with this photo?  Yes it is a beautiful shot of a sunset, and in challenge where this is the theme you may have gotten a high mark and done quite well. However, explain to me how this fits in with "Team Sport Action"???<br/> <br/>for Challenge: Sunsets                       7<br/>for Challenge: Team Sport Action       1<br/></td>', 'OK..... so just what do you expect to get with this photo?  Yes it is a beautiful shot of a sunset, and in challenge where this is the theme you may have gotten a high mark and done quite well. However, explain to me how this fits in with "Team Sport Action"??? for Challenge: Sunsets                       7for Challenge: Team Sport Action       1', '2004-09-15 11:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(911318, 105248, 25483, '<td valign="top">This would have been a nice photo if you used a faster shutter speed and a flash and then bring in your photo to Photoshop and adjust levels and brightness/contrast to improve the dark image.  Remember that you can recover much of the detail in your images that are underexposed and not clipped in your histogram.  But this is a night shot and I know they are tough to do.  <br/> <br/>Try downloading the demo version of Neat Image, it will drastically improve the noise that you have in your photo.  Its improved my photos tremendously.<br/> <br/>Good Luck<br/></td>', 'This would have been a nice photo if you used a faster shutter speed and a flash and then bring in your photo to Photoshop and adjust levels and brightness/contrast to improve the dark image.  Remember that you can recover much of the detail in your images that are underexposed and not clipped in your histogram.  But this is a night shot and I know they are tough to do.   Try downloading the demo version of Neat Image, it will drastically improve the noise that you have in your photo.  Its improved my photos tremendously. Good Luck', '2004-09-15 11:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(911320, 104935, 25483, '<td valign="top">Very good composition.  The lighting is very good, so is the DOF and you used the right shutter speed to freeze the action.  You should do well with this one.</td>', 'Very good composition.  The lighting is very good, so is the DOF and you used the right shutter speed to freeze the action.  You should do well with this one.', '2004-09-15 11:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(911323, 104079, 25483, '<td valign="top">That spectators head ruined what otherwise would have been a fairly nice shot.</td>', 'That spectators head ruined what otherwise would have been a fairly nice shot.', '2004-09-15 12:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
