(911391, 105196, 25903, '<td valign="top">This would have been more effective if you''d cropped the top and bottom of the picture. This would eliminate the blur in front/bottom and the distraction of the stands at the top.  I like the facial expression you''ve captured on #12.</td>', 'This would have been more effective if you''d cropped the top and bottom of the picture. This would eliminate the blur in front/bottom and the distraction of the stands at the top.  I like the facial expression you''ve captured on #12.', '2004-09-15 12:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
