(913532, 104827, 23561, '<td valign="top">Took me a minute to "get it", but once I did I raised the score. I like the concept and the "extra", but as a stand alone shot it is kind of boring. I can''t see the expressions on any of the players face and the head sticking up is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Took me a minute to "get it", but once I did I raised the score. I like the concept and the "extra", but as a stand alone shot it is kind of boring. I can''t see the expressions on any of the players face and the head sticking up is a bit distracting.', '2004-09-16 19:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
