(913557, 104394, 5677, '<td valign="top">I think your title really makes this photo.  I would have had no clue as to what you were going for without it.  It might have been better had you drawn a play, with arrows or something showing where players should go.  Also, everything seems out of focus.  The surface that the formation is drawn on seems odd.  Maybe it''s just weird lighting or something.</td>', 'I think your title really makes this photo.  I would have had no clue as to what you were going for without it.  It might have been better had you drawn a play, with arrows or something showing where players should go.  Also, everything seems out of focus.  The surface that the formation is drawn on seems odd.  Maybe it''s just weird lighting or something.', '2004-09-16 19:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
