(913598, 104410, 23561, '<td valign="top">I usually complain about frames, but I really like this one and think it enhances the photo. Probably couldn''t get a better composition if they had posed! Colors look great, really pop! Only way to improve this shot would be if the players had uniforms, preferable the red and yellow already present. Photo feels a little bit unbalanced because it look like three teams are playing instead of two. Still a way above average shot.</td>', 'I usually complain about frames, but I really like this one and think it enhances the photo. Probably couldn''t get a better composition if they had posed! Colors look great, really pop! Only way to improve this shot would be if the players had uniforms, preferable the red and yellow already present. Photo feels a little bit unbalanced because it look like three teams are playing instead of two. Still a way above average shot.', '2004-09-16 20:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
