(913692, 105484, 23561, '<td valign="top">This is a good picture. Nice composition. Above average, just not a favorite.</td>', 'This is a good picture. Nice composition. Above average, just not a favorite.', '2004-09-16 21:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(913702, 105255, 23561, '<td valign="top">Boy, oh boy. How to rate this? Well, soccor is a team sport, and you did capture action (I can''t wait to see how many tries it took to get this), and you obviously put a lot of effort into this. Composition and lighting all look professional, and I do like how the focus seems to be on the goalie. The "player" taking the shot looks like he is about to fall over though. I gave this an above average score, but it just wasn''t one of my favorites this round. I guess it is just lacking in emotion, but I could see the Lego company using this for an ad.</td>', 'Boy, oh boy. How to rate this? Well, soccor is a team sport, and you did capture action (I can''t wait to see how many tries it took to get this), and you obviously put a lot of effort into this. Composition and lighting all look professional, and I do like how the focus seems to be on the goalie. The "player" taking the shot looks like he is about to fall over though. I gave this an above average score, but it just wasn''t one of my favorites this round. I guess it is just lacking in emotion, but I could see the Lego company using this for an ad.', '2004-09-16 21:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(913704, 104023, 25655, '<td valign="top">Ok, got your point. Nice idea.<br/>I don''t like it though, and I don''t think it actualy represent a team sport action, since none of us here at DPC run as a team...<br/>I gave you a 4 just for the idea...</td>', 'Ok, got your point. Nice idea.I don''t like it though, and I don''t think it actualy represent a team sport action, since none of us here at DPC run as a team...I gave you a 4 just for the idea...', '2004-09-16 21:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(913706, 105239, 23561, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo, but IMO it may have been better with a portrait crop. Just seems like too much empty space. Average score.</td>', 'This is a good photo, but IMO it may have been better with a portrait crop. Just seems like too much empty space. Average score.', '2004-09-16 21:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(913708, 105409, 23561, '<td valign="top">Excellent candid portrait. Above average, just not my favorite for this challenge.</td>', 'Excellent candid portrait. Above average, just not my favorite for this challenge.', '2004-09-16 21:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(913710, 105344, 23561, '<td valign="top">Love the expressions captured. Focus is a bit soft IMO, but still an above average photo.</td>', 'Love the expressions captured. Focus is a bit soft IMO, but still an above average photo.', '2004-09-16 21:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(913716, 105237, 23561, '<td valign="top">Point of view is very creative. Can''t help but wonder if your player jumped from a ladder or trampoline because he is up so high! Composition looks good to me. Not crazy about the near silhoutte, wish it was a bit brighter. Above average score.</td>', 'Point of view is very creative. Can''t help but wonder if your player jumped from a ladder or trampoline because he is up so high! Composition looks good to me. Not crazy about the near silhoutte, wish it was a bit brighter. Above average score.', '2004-09-16 21:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(913720, 105415, 23561, '<td valign="top">I scored this a little above average. I like the colors and the composition but I wish I could see the expression on the face of the main subjects. Back side is just not very interesting.</td>', 'I scored this a little above average. I like the colors and the composition but I wish I could see the expression on the face of the main subjects. Back side is just not very interesting.', '2004-09-16 21:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(913724, 105332, 23561, '<td valign="top">Looks like Kickball to me. As for the photo, I can''t decide who the main subject is, the "kicker" or the ones who seem to be waiting their turn. The "kicker" is a bit out of focus and that distracts somewhat from the balance of the shot. Gave this an average score.</td>', 'Looks like Kickball to me. As for the photo, I can''t decide who the main subject is, the "kicker" or the ones who seem to be waiting their turn. The "kicker" is a bit out of focus and that distracts somewhat from the balance of the shot. Gave this an average score.', '2004-09-16 21:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(913725, 104980, 23561, '<td valign="top">What to say... Composition looks good to me, good lighting and color. Like the expressions caught. Above average, just not my favorite this round.</td>', 'What to say... Composition looks good to me, good lighting and color. Like the expressions caught. Above average, just not my favorite this round.', '2004-09-16 21:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(913731, 104079, 26653, '<td valign="top">Would have been much better if you could have moved the head/hat, and put the catcher fully in the shot.  Oh well.</td>', 'Would have been much better if you could have moved the head/hat, and put the catcher fully in the shot.  Oh well.', '2004-09-16 21:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(913733, 105248, 26653, '<td valign="top">Great job catching the action and the expression!</td>', 'Great job catching the action and the expression!', '2004-09-16 21:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(913734, 104295, 26653, '<td valign="top">I wonder if some fill flash would have brought out the colors a little more<br/></td>', 'I wonder if some fill flash would have brought out the colors a little more', '2004-09-16 21:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(913735, 104388, 26653, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the composition.</td>', 'I like the colors and the composition.', '2004-09-16 21:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(913737, 104849, 26653, '<td valign="top">great colors, and I like the expression you captured.  would like to see it a little sharper.</td>', 'great colors, and I like the expression you captured.  would like to see it a little sharper.', '2004-09-16 21:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(913741, 105473, 26653, '<td valign="top">Too much blur, even the audience is blurred.  Maybe a faster ISO?</td>', 'Too much blur, even the audience is blurred.  Maybe a faster ISO?', '2004-09-16 21:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(913743, 105476, 26653, '<td valign="top">an interesting angle.  I think it would be more effective if you put the frisbee in sharp focus and the rest soft - norrow dof.  This whole shot looks soft to me.  The hand seems to draw the eye as much or more than the frisbee does and it''s a bit hot.</td>', 'an interesting angle.  I think it would be more effective if you put the frisbee in sharp focus and the rest soft - norrow dof.  This whole shot looks soft to me.  The hand seems to draw the eye as much or more than the frisbee does and it''s a bit hot.', '2004-09-16 22:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(913747, 105437, 26653, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, beautiful colors.  I think an angle that shows some faces and the net might have been even more appealing.</td>', 'Nice and sharp, beautiful colors.  I think an angle that shows some faces and the net might have been even more appealing.', '2004-09-16 22:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(913749, 105415, 26653, '<td valign="top">Nice light and colors on this, and nice dof.</td>', 'Nice light and colors on this, and nice dof.', '2004-09-16 22:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(913754, 104877, 26653, '<td valign="top">nice job, got all body parts in the frame.  Good stop action.</td>', 'nice job, got all body parts in the frame.  Good stop action.', '2004-09-16 22:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(913756, 105344, 26653, '<td valign="top">Great expressions.  I want to see just a little above where the frame cuts off.</td>', 'Great expressions.  I want to see just a little above where the frame cuts off.', '2004-09-16 22:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(913761, 105210, 26653, '<td valign="top">seems a strange point of focus??</td>', 'seems a strange point of focus??', '2004-09-16 22:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(913763, 105433, 26653, '<td valign="top">good timing and stop action.  Great colors. Well done.</td>', 'good timing and stop action.  Great colors. Well done.', '2004-09-16 22:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(913764, 105396, 26653, '<td valign="top">neat shot!</td>', 'neat shot!', '2004-09-16 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(913767, 104711, 26653, '<td valign="top">Too bad they weren''t rowing with the sun on their faces.  Nice diagonal composition.</td>', 'Too bad they weren''t rowing with the sun on their faces.  Nice diagonal composition.', '2004-09-16 22:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(913778, 105483, 26653, '<td valign="top">ouch!  I keep trying to see if his foot was twisted around, but it''s cut off.</td>', 'ouch!  I keep trying to see if his foot was twisted around, but it''s cut off.', '2004-09-16 22:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(913852, 104023, 23561, '<td valign="top">This may get the brown ribbon. No team, no sports, no action.</td>', 'This may get the brown ribbon. No team, no sports, no action.', '2004-09-16 23:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(913857, 104937, 23561, '<td valign="top">Well, they are flying, so I''ll give you the action part of the challenge but this isn''t a sport even if they are a team.</td>', 'Well, they are flying, so I''ll give you the action part of the challenge but this isn''t a sport even if they are a team.', '2004-09-16 23:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(913860, 104741, 23561, '<td valign="top">No team, no sports, no action. Don''t really care for it as a landscape shot either. Nothing to focus on.</td>', 'No team, no sports, no action. Don''t really care for it as a landscape shot either. Nothing to focus on.', '2004-09-16 23:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(913864, 104712, 23561, '<td valign="top">I can see a team in the background and I guess the photographer taking pictures is supposed to represent the action, but I really felt this didn''t meet the spirit of the challenge. On the photo by itself, the fence is distracting.</td>', 'I can see a team in the background and I guess the photographer taking pictures is supposed to represent the action, but I really felt this didn''t meet the spirit of the challenge. On the photo by itself, the fence is distracting.', '2004-09-16 23:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(913866, 105408, 23561, '<td valign="top">I rated this picture low because there was''t any action in it and I couldn''t tell what sport it was supposed to be.</td>', 'I rated this picture low because there was''t any action in it and I couldn''t tell what sport it was supposed to be.', '2004-09-16 23:25:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(913869, 104394, 23561, '<td valign="top">Voted low because I felt it didn''t meet the challenge.</td>', 'Voted low because I felt it didn''t meet the challenge.', '2004-09-16 23:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(913873, 104650, 23561, '<td valign="top">I voted this low because there was not really any action going on in the shot.</td>', 'I voted this low because there was not really any action going on in the shot.', '2004-09-16 23:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(913876, 105297, 23561, '<td valign="top">I voted this picture low for two reasons. The first being that there isn''t any action going on. The second was because I thought it was kind of boring seeing only the backs of the team as well as the coaches.</td>', 'I voted this picture low for two reasons. The first being that there isn''t any action going on. The second was because I thought it was kind of boring seeing only the backs of the team as well as the coaches.', '2004-09-16 23:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(913877, 105308, 23561, '<td valign="top">I voted this low mainly because there was no action taking place. I also don''t like the color. Looks almost B&amp;W except for the green ball caps, and there is too much dead space IMO.</td>', 'I voted this low mainly because there was no action taking place. I also don''t like the color. Looks almost B&W except for the green ball caps, and there is too much dead space IMO.', '2004-09-16 23:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(913879, 105267, 23561, '<td valign="top">I voted low on this shot because there isn''t any action. Looks like a lot a waiting to me. Otherwise, I thought this was a pretty good picture.</td>', 'I voted low on this shot because there isn''t any action. Looks like a lot a waiting to me. Otherwise, I thought this was a pretty good picture.', '2004-09-16 23:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(913883, 104827, 21034, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a wacky shot.  ;)</td>', 'Wow, what a wacky shot.  ;)', '2004-09-16 23:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(913892, 105162, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like the humor factor in this shot, but sneering is not IMO an action. Sorry.</td>', 'I like the humor factor in this shot, but sneering is not IMO an action. Sorry.', '2004-09-16 23:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(913893, 105251, 23561, '<td valign="top">Voted low on this shot because there is no action going on.</td>', 'Voted low on this shot because there is no action going on.', '2004-09-16 23:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(913894, 105394, 23561, '<td valign="top">Voted this low because there was no action.</td>', 'Voted this low because there was no action.', '2004-09-16 23:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(913897, 105204, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and I loved the Harry Potter series (can''t wait for book 6!), but overall the picture is a bit boring. The detail in the "wings" of your "snich" almost get lost in the silhouette, and there is a lot of dead space. Also not much action going on.</td>', 'I like the concept and I loved the Harry Potter series (can''t wait for book 6!), but overall the picture is a bit boring. The detail in the "wings" of your "snich" almost get lost in the silhouette, and there is a lot of dead space. Also not much action going on.', '2004-09-17 00:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(913899, 104212, 23561, '<td valign="top">Well, I almost hate to comment on this, but here goes. First thought was yuck, look at all that (well, I won''t say what I thought it was but it was worse than quicksand). The composition is good, except the fingers are a little too coated in gook and almost get lost in the stuff. Also, there doesn''t seem to be any action taking place, and that was part of this challenge.</td>', 'Well, I almost hate to comment on this, but here goes. First thought was yuck, look at all that (well, I won''t say what I thought it was but it was worse than quicksand). The composition is good, except the fingers are a little too coated in gook and almost get lost in the stuff. Also, there doesn''t seem to be any action taking place, and that was part of this challenge.', '2004-09-17 00:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(913900, 105476, 23561, '<td valign="top">I voted this low because of the lack of action.</td>', 'I voted this low because of the lack of action.', '2004-09-17 00:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(913901, 104495, 26653, '<td valign="top">I recognize the face mask violation, but what do they call the other one??  :-)<br/>Nice shot, it''s good to see the front of the action instead of chasing after it.<br/>Nice and sharp too.</td>', 'I recognize the face mask violation, but what do they call the other one??  :-)Nice shot, it''s good to see the front of the action instead of chasing after it.Nice and sharp too.', '2004-09-17 00:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(913903, 105470, 23561, '<td valign="top">Voted this low because 1)foosball isn''t a team sport and 2) there is no action taking place. I do like the colors though.</td>', 'Voted this low because 1)foosball isn''t a team sport and 2) there is no action taking place. I do like the colors though.', '2004-09-17 00:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(913904, 105260, 26653, '<td valign="top">If you ''d been just a little to the right, you would have gotten more of each of the players, and maybe a good facial expression.<br/>nice catch of the action tho</td>', 'If you ''d been just a little to the right, you would have gotten more of each of the players, and maybe a good facial expression.nice catch of the action tho', '2004-09-17 00:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(913905, 104888, 23561, '<td valign="top">Voted low for lack of action.</td>', 'Voted low for lack of action.', '2004-09-17 00:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(913907, 105396, 23561, '<td valign="top">I liked the B&amp;W and use of negative space, but still voted low because there was no action.</td>', 'I liked the B&W and use of negative space, but still voted low because there was no action.', '2004-09-17 00:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(913908, 105485, 23561, '<td valign="top">I voted average on this photo. Baseball is a team sport, and the cardboard cut-out sliding into home represents the action. The Dodger uniform across the top just doesn''t seem to fit with the rest of the shot IMO. Sorry.</td>', 'I voted average on this photo. Baseball is a team sport, and the cardboard cut-out sliding into home represents the action. The Dodger uniform across the top just doesn''t seem to fit with the rest of the shot IMO. Sorry.', '2004-09-17 00:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(913909, 104680, 23561, '<td valign="top">I liked the color and composition of this shot, but there is no action.</td>', 'I liked the color and composition of this shot, but there is no action.', '2004-09-17 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(913910, 105442, 23561, '<td valign="top">Voted low due to size of photo. Too small to really see what is going on.</td>', 'Voted low due to size of photo. Too small to really see what is going on.', '2004-09-17 00:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(913912, 105035, 22686, '<td valign="top">This was not the sharpest or the most colourful photo but it was my personal favourite. It is beautifully framed and captures the moment pefectly.</td>', 'This was not the sharpest or the most colourful photo but it was my personal favourite. It is beautifully framed and captures the moment pefectly.', '2004-09-17 00:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(913913, 105210, 23561, '<td valign="top">I didn''t like the focus on this image and there isn''t any action going on. Just IMO, sorry.</td>', 'I didn''t like the focus on this image and there isn''t any action going on. Just IMO, sorry.', '2004-09-17 00:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(913918, 104379, 23561, '<td valign="top">Had trouble deciding how to vote on this picture. The currency does show a team sport with action, but your picture is of the currency! I guess it fits the challenge, but the photo by itself doesn''t do much for me. The light reflection in the top right is distracting as is the penny in the bottom left. Don''t really care for the way the bill is curling either. Just my opinion, sorry.</td>', 'Had trouble deciding how to vote on this picture. The currency does show a team sport with action, but your picture is of the currency! I guess it fits the challenge, but the photo by itself doesn''t do much for me. The light reflection in the top right is distracting as is the penny in the bottom left. Don''t really care for the way the bill is curling either. Just my opinion, sorry.', '2004-09-17 00:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(913919, 104929, 23561, '<td valign="top">Voted low because there was no action taking place.</td>', 'Voted low because there was no action taking place.', '2004-09-17 00:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(913920, 104076, 23561, '<td valign="top">Voted low because there was no action.</td>', 'Voted low because there was no action.', '2004-09-17 00:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(913922, 105033, 23561, '<td valign="top">Voted low because there was no action.</td>', 'Voted low because there was no action.', '2004-09-17 00:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(913925, 105414, 23561, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge, but the picture is too small to really see it well and looks a bit out of focus.</td>', 'This meets the challenge, but the picture is too small to really see it well and looks a bit out of focus.', '2004-09-17 00:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(913927, 105480, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like the composition on this photo, but I felt that it was lacking in action.</td>', 'I like the composition on this photo, but I felt that it was lacking in action.', '2004-09-17 00:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(913931, 105468, 23561, '<td valign="top">OK, with that title you can squeeze in and fit the challenge. Subject seems a bit out of focus IMO. The background is a little too busy. May have scored higher if the background didn''t distract as much. I like where the rider is placed in the frame.</td>', 'OK, with that title you can squeeze in and fit the challenge. Subject seems a bit out of focus IMO. The background is a little too busy. May have scored higher if the background didn''t distract as much. I like where the rider is placed in the frame.', '2004-09-17 00:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(913934, 104694, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like the concept even if some don''t think of cheerleading as a sport. As for the photo, IMO it may have done better as a centered composition with the main focus on the girl at the top of the pyramid. In this shot the lighting seems to make my eyes go to the girl whose back is towards me even though I prefer the smile of the girl on top.</td>', 'I like the concept even if some don''t think of cheerleading as a sport. As for the photo, IMO it may have done better as a centered composition with the main focus on the girl at the top of the pyramid. In this shot the lighting seems to make my eyes go to the girl whose back is towards me even though I prefer the smile of the girl on top.', '2004-09-17 00:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(913940, 104730, 23561, '<td valign="top">Hmm, team sport? Well, they do call it a swim team don''t they! Overall a good shot. I like the B&amp;W and centered composition best, and the water does look cool. Don''t like how the top of the head is cut off and it probably shouldn''t matter but it looks like the swimmer only has one tooth on the bottom row. Probably a trick from the light, but it is a bit distracting and such a young and otherwise very handsome young man. Gave this an average score.</td>', 'Hmm, team sport? Well, they do call it a swim team don''t they! Overall a good shot. I like the B&W and centered composition best, and the water does look cool. Don''t like how the top of the head is cut off and it probably shouldn''t matter but it looks like the swimmer only has one tooth on the bottom row. Probably a trick from the light, but it is a bit distracting and such a young and otherwise very handsome young man. Gave this an average score.', '2004-09-17 00:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(913942, 104822, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like composition of this picture. Balance of city (work,crowds,smog) and ball field (play,open space, fresh air) makes a statement. I would love to see this shot without the top of the building on the right cut off, and maybe with a little more of the field at the bottom. As far as this challenge however it was a bit too far back to really get to see any of the action IMO. I gave this an average score.</td>', 'I like composition of this picture. Balance of city (work,crowds,smog) and ball field (play,open space, fresh air) makes a statement. I would love to see this shot without the top of the building on the right cut off, and maybe with a little more of the field at the bottom. As far as this challenge however it was a bit too far back to really get to see any of the action IMO. I gave this an average score.', '2004-09-17 01:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(913948, 105355, 23561, '<td valign="top">I didn''t know that kayak racing was a team sport. I like the composition of this picture and the color of his shirt gives the photo some pop, but I wish I could see the expression on the face better. It feels a bit out of focus IMO. I gave this a 5.</td>', 'I didn''t know that kayak racing was a team sport. I like the composition of this picture and the color of his shirt gives the photo some pop, but I wish I could see the expression on the face better. It feels a bit out of focus IMO. I gave this a 5.', '2004-09-17 01:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(913949, 104212, 4267, '<td valign="top">for me, this does not meet the challenge... it completely relies on the title</td>', 'for me, this does not meet the challenge... it completely relies on the title', '2004-09-17 01:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(913950, 105473, 4267, '<td valign="top">not a good use of blur</td>', 'not a good use of blur', '2004-09-17 01:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(913952, 105198, 4267, '<td valign="top">ho hum.. needs a better angle</td>', 'ho hum.. needs a better angle', '2004-09-17 01:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(913953, 105408, 4267, '<td valign="top">can''t really tell that they are involved in a sport</td>', 'can''t really tell that they are involved in a sport', '2004-09-17 01:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(913954, 105460, 23561, '<td valign="top">You got the challenge (soccer is a team sport and the way the ball is overhead seems to indicate it is ready to be thrown, suggesting action) but the photo is a bit boring IMO.</td>', 'You got the challenge (soccer is a team sport and the way the ball is overhead seems to indicate it is ready to be thrown, suggesting action) but the photo is a bit boring IMO.', '2004-09-17 01:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(913955, 105400, 4267, '<td valign="top">looks more like goofing off than a sport</td>', 'looks more like goofing off than a sport', '2004-09-17 01:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(913956, 105485, 4267, '<td valign="top">too much use of someone elses work</td>', 'too much use of someone elses work', '2004-09-17 01:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(913958, 104712, 4267, '<td valign="top">the blur does not work here, and the main subject is not the team sport but the photographer.. this photo does not meet the challenge for me</td>', 'the blur does not work here, and the main subject is not the team sport but the photographer.. this photo does not meet the challenge for me', '2004-09-17 01:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(913959, 105393, 4267, '<td valign="top">ahh finally a photo I like... the sky is a little washed out... maybe contrast/brightness adjustments?</td>', 'ahh finally a photo I like... the sky is a little washed out... maybe contrast/brightness adjustments?', '2004-09-17 01:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(913960, 105260, 26526, '<td valign="top">Volleyball ballet!</td>', 'Volleyball ballet!', '2004-09-17 01:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(913961, 104650, 4267, '<td valign="top">i doubt most people on here even realize these guys are cricket players... just looks like a couple of guys in sweaters</td>', 'i doubt most people on here even realize these guys are cricket players... just looks like a couple of guys in sweaters', '2004-09-17 01:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(913963, 105475, 23561, '<td valign="top">OK, this meets the challenge, but the players standing in the background just watching this "scrimage" seems a bit odd, especially since there obviously not on the sidelines. You did get a pretty good view of the expression on 77''s face, even with the helmet being in the way. I gave this a 6.</td>', 'OK, this meets the challenge, but the players standing in the background just watching this "scrimage" seems a bit odd, especially since there obviously not on the sidelines. You did get a pretty good view of the expression on 77''s face, even with the helmet being in the way. I gave this a 6.', '2004-09-17 01:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
