(914004, 105473, 23561, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I gave this a 4 the first time around (just my quickview vote) because of the lack of focus. On a second look I think I may have been a bit hasty. The 22 is clear enough and appears to be the main subject of your photo. With the title (minus the period) there does seem to be a bit of grace to this shot. While it is still not my favorite for this round, I am bumping this up to an 8.</td>', 'Hmm, I gave this a 4 the first time around (just my quickview vote) because of the lack of focus. On a second look I think I may have been a bit hasty. The 22 is clear enough and appears to be the main subject of your photo. With the title (minus the period) there does seem to be a bit of grace to this shot. While it is still not my favorite for this round, I am bumping this up to an 8.', '2004-09-17 01:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
