(914010, 104689, 25464, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  It is a bit on the grainy side (not necessarily a bad thing in my opinion, just observation), and it would have been even better if the background had been blurred and the crop left a bit of space in front of the subject (left side)instead of behind (right side).  I think that would have helped illustrate motion.  What a great subject.  Good job. 7.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  It is a bit on the grainy side (not necessarily a bad thing in my opinion, just observation), and it would have been even better if the background had been blurred and the crop left a bit of space in front of the subject (left side)instead of behind (right side).  I think that would have helped illustrate motion.  What a great subject.  Good job. 7.', '2004-09-17 01:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
