(914038, 105385, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like the B&amp;W and the composition of this shot. The splashing and ducking show an "action", but I think the title hurts a bit in this challenge. I also wish the guy getting splashed didn''t have his arm covering his face. I feel like I''m missing out on something, not getting to see the expression of the main subjects face. I gave this a 6.</td>', 'I like the B&W and the composition of this shot. The splashing and ducking show an "action", but I think the title hurts a bit in this challenge. I also wish the guy getting splashed didn''t have his arm covering his face. I feel like I''m missing out on something, not getting to see the expression of the main subjects face. I gave this a 6.', '2004-09-17 01:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
