(914062, 104771, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like how you captured the top bar spinning and the composition is nice, but I am having trouble seeing foosball as a team sport. I gave this a five.</td>', 'I like how you captured the top bar spinning and the composition is nice, but I am having trouble seeing foosball as a team sport. I gave this a five.', '2004-09-17 01:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(914070, 104848, 23561, '<td valign="top">OK, I won''t deduct because of team aspect. Swimmer looks a bit young for a "mens" freestyle though. On the whole it is a very nice shot. Composition and lighting are excellent. Water looks inviting. Only thing that bothers me is the swimmers closed eyes. Can''t help but wonder if he can stay in his lane. Gave this a 7.</td>', 'OK, I won''t deduct because of team aspect. Swimmer looks a bit young for a "mens" freestyle though. On the whole it is a very nice shot. Composition and lighting are excellent. Water looks inviting. Only thing that bothers me is the swimmers closed eyes. Can''t help but wonder if he can stay in his lane. Gave this a 7.', '2004-09-17 01:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
