(914163, 105198, 21158, '<td valign="top">nice pic but I would have liked to see the players running towards me so I could see the emotion in their faces</td>', 'nice pic but I would have liked to see the players running towards me so I could see the emotion in their faces', '2004-09-17 04:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(914164, 105476, 23300, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and this shot has a candid feel that is quite involving. I think the white sky works well however I feel the overexposure on the hands detracts from the casual vibe of the image. I feel a sharper focus would enhance this photo especially if it brought out the texture in the jeans. I think this would also work well in Black and White as it would enhance the impactt of the white sky. Good Luck.</td>', 'I really like the composition and this shot has a candid feel that is quite involving. I think the white sky works well however I feel the overexposure on the hands detracts from the casual vibe of the image. I feel a sharper focus would enhance this photo especially if it brought out the texture in the jeans. I think this would also work well in Black and White as it would enhance the impactt of the white sky. Good Luck.', '2004-09-17 04:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(914166, 104495, 21158, '<td valign="top">good capture, I would have rotated to make the field level. It makes it look like they are playing on a hill. I like the vivid colors. Now I won''t make too much of a fuss over placement of the running back''s hand or the blocker''s holding foul on the mask of his opponent. 6</td>', 'good capture, I would have rotated to make the field level. It makes it look like they are playing on a hill. I like the vivid colors. Now I won''t make too much of a fuss over placement of the running back''s hand or the blocker''s holding foul on the mask of his opponent. 6', '2004-09-17 04:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(914167, 104888, 21158, '<td valign="top">nice clear image. Not much action to speak of. If only we could see the talker. 6</td>', 'nice clear image. Not much action to speak of. If only we could see the talker. 6', '2004-09-17 04:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(914168, 105132, 23300, '<td valign="top">I think the composition really works well as it gives a real sense of the action as well as a sense of the environment that the game is being played in. I can almost feel the grass under my feet. :)  The light people work well against the shadows of the trees. The shadows in the foreground add interest and depth to the scene as does the light on the upper sections of the leaves. The more I look at it the more dynamic it looks. I think the motion blur is good as it adds to the energy. The only thing I could pick on is a bit of over exposure on the really bright elements in the shot. This image could also work really well if it was cropped fairly close to the top and bottom of the people. Good Luck.</td>', 'I think the composition really works well as it gives a real sense of the action as well as a sense of the environment that the game is being played in. I can almost feel the grass under my feet. :)  The light people work well against the shadows of the trees. The shadows in the foreground add interest and depth to the scene as does the light on the upper sections of the leaves. The more I look at it the more dynamic it looks. I think the motion blur is good as it adds to the energy. The only thing I could pick on is a bit of over exposure on the really bright elements in the shot. This image could also work really well if it was cropped fairly close to the top and bottom of the people. Good Luck.', '2004-09-17 04:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(914170, 104757, 23300, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of a candid moment. It may also work well if it was cropped around the three central figures from their waste to above their heads to really get in on the core of the moment.</td>', 'Excellent capture of a candid moment. It may also work well if it was cropped around the three central figures from their waste to above their heads to really get in on the core of the moment.', '2004-09-17 05:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(914171, 105196, 21158, '<td valign="top">what a nice picture this would have been if you haven''t caught the spectators head. The expression on the boy''s face: priceless..</td>', 'what a nice picture this would have been if you haven''t caught the spectators head. The expression on the boy''s face: priceless..', '2004-09-17 05:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(914172, 105435, 21158, '<td valign="top">foul!!! good shot</td>', 'foul!!! good shot', '2004-09-17 05:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(914174, 104980, 21158, '<td valign="top">good shot</td>', 'good shot', '2004-09-17 05:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(914175, 105308, 23300, '<td valign="top">I love this image. I believe it has been artistically executed and produced. The sense of space is awesome and the contrast to the "action" element is brilliant. You have really emphasized the isolation of the subjects through the starkness of the way you have treated the colour. This is inspirational. Thank you for this entry.</td>', 'I love this image. I believe it has been artistically executed and produced. The sense of space is awesome and the contrast to the "action" element is brilliant. You have really emphasized the isolation of the subjects through the starkness of the way you have treated the colour. This is inspirational. Thank you for this entry.', '2004-09-17 05:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(914177, 105447, 21158, '<td valign="top">great capture. 8</td>', 'great capture. 8', '2004-09-17 05:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(914178, 105471, 23300, '<td valign="top">The composition works really well. I think the contrast between the crowd and the field enhances the scale of the scene. I wonder if cropping the sky out of the background might tighten the attention to the action on the field. The colours are vibrant and this adds to the richness of the scene.</td>', 'The composition works really well. I think the contrast between the crowd and the field enhances the scale of the scene. I wonder if cropping the sky out of the background might tighten the attention to the action on the field. The colours are vibrant and this adds to the richness of the scene.', '2004-09-17 05:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(914179, 105195, 21158, '<td valign="top">too small hard to see detail</td>', 'too small hard to see detail', '2004-09-17 05:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(914180, 105195, 23300, '<td valign="top">This is a good subject for the challenge. I wonder if cropping it more tightly around the players would really intensify the emotion of the image. For example cropped below the signs in the background and just below the players'' feet. It is a very small image which makes it a bit hard to see. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a good subject for the challenge. I wonder if cropping it more tightly around the players would really intensify the emotion of the image. For example cropped below the signs in the background and just below the players'' feet. It is a very small image which makes it a bit hard to see. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-09-17 05:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(914181, 104079, 21158, '<td valign="top">HEY YOU!! DOWN IN FRONT!!! Nice pic spoiled by the cap</td>', 'HEY YOU!! DOWN IN FRONT!!! Nice pic spoiled by the cap', '2004-09-17 05:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(914182, 104712, 21158, '<td valign="top">check your metering. OOF. Nice equipment though</td>', 'check your metering. OOF. Nice equipment though', '2004-09-17 05:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(914185, 105162, 23300, '<td valign="top">No doubt this one gets an instant laugh. It certainly makes an impact. You could just about crop it aroud the young fella''s face and make an image out of that. I''m imagining his face in black and white with a touch of noise added. His eyes nose and brow are really expresive. This image does kind of grow on ya. Good Luck.</td>', 'No doubt this one gets an instant laugh. It certainly makes an impact. You could just about crop it aroud the young fella''s face and make an image out of that. I''m imagining his face in black and white with a touch of noise added. His eyes nose and brow are really expresive. This image does kind of grow on ya. Good Luck.', '2004-09-17 05:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(914186, 104630, 21158, '<td valign="top">nice detail, right down to where I see his shoelace is untied. good pic</td>', 'nice detail, right down to where I see his shoelace is untied. good pic', '2004-09-17 05:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(914187, 105484, 21158, '<td valign="top">no words needed, good pic</td>', 'no words needed, good pic', '2004-09-17 05:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(914188, 104822, 23300, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast between the skyline and the field. The colours in the image are beautiful. It is a little soft in that it hasn''t got a great deal of contrast. It provides a great sense of space and scale.</td>', 'I love the contrast between the skyline and the field. The colours in the image are beautiful. It is a little soft in that it hasn''t got a great deal of contrast. It provides a great sense of space and scale.', '2004-09-17 05:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(914189, 104877, 21158, '<td valign="top">good DOF</td>', 'good DOF', '2004-09-17 05:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(914190, 105235, 21158, '<td valign="top">good pic</td>', 'good pic', '2004-09-17 05:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(914191, 105471, 21158, '<td valign="top">good pic, nice border</td>', 'good pic, nice border', '2004-09-17 05:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(914195, 105435, 23300, '<td valign="top">The action in this image is quite compelling. I think it would benefit from being cropped tighter around the three main figures to enhance the action. Also I wonder how it would look in Black and White. I think this would make it a bit more timeless or sort of anonymous which would again enhance the action. Good luck.</td>', 'The action in this image is quite compelling. I think it would benefit from being cropped tighter around the three main figures to enhance the action. Also I wonder how it would look in Black and White. I think this would make it a bit more timeless or sort of anonymous which would again enhance the action. Good luck.', '2004-09-17 05:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(914197, 105480, 26334, '<td valign="top">wow . lgot shot man!</td>', 'wow . lgot shot man!', '2004-09-17 05:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(914199, 105344, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like the difference in the two facial expressions. One for defeat and one still trying. The composition works well, including the absence of the ball. I didn''t expect to see Aussie Rules in this challenge. Good luck.<br/>P.S. I think conversion to Black and White would give this a "timeless" feel. Just a thought. :)</td>', 'I like the difference in the two facial expressions. One for defeat and one still trying. The composition works well, including the absence of the ball. I didn''t expect to see Aussie Rules in this challenge. Good luck.P.S. I think conversion to Black and White would give this a "timeless" feel. Just a thought. :)', '2004-09-17 05:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(914200, 105400, 26526, '<td valign="top">This is a terrific photo, and got top scoring from me. I couldn''t find a thing you could have done differently to improve on this photo.</td>', 'This is a terrific photo, and got top scoring from me. I couldn''t find a thing you could have done differently to improve on this photo.', '2004-09-17 05:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(914201, 105251, 23300, '<td valign="top">The composition works well. It was nice of the clouds to sit just like that :) This is a strong image. I would have rotated it a bit to keep the backboard parallel to the bottom of the image. good Luck.</td>', 'The composition works well. It was nice of the clouds to sit just like that :) This is a strong image. I would have rotated it a bit to keep the backboard parallel to the bottom of the image. good Luck.', '2004-09-17 05:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(914204, 104888, 26334, '<td valign="top">Graet picture</td>', 'Graet picture', '2004-09-17 05:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(914205, 105485, 23300, '<td valign="top">The sepia works well. It gives it a timeless and nostalgic feel. The cropping also helps to enhance the impact of the action and the border works well too. There is something odd about the man on the right. He looks a bit like a cardboard cutout :)<br/>Good Luck.</td>', 'The sepia works well. It gives it a timeless and nostalgic feel. The cropping also helps to enhance the impact of the action and the border works well too. There is something odd about the man on the right. He looks a bit like a cardboard cutout :)Good Luck.', '2004-09-17 05:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(914206, 104887, 26334, '<td valign="top">Superb picture</td>', 'Superb picture', '2004-09-17 05:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(914208, 105260, 23300, '<td valign="top">I really like the symmetry produced by the two guys by the net. I wonder if cropping the image around them might have enhanced the effect.</td>', 'I really like the symmetry produced by the two guys by the net. I wonder if cropping the image around them might have enhanced the effect.', '2004-09-17 05:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(914209, 105446, 26334, '<td valign="top">Great picture</td>', 'Great picture', '2004-09-17 05:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(914211, 104726, 26526, '<td valign="top">This photo has everything it needs for a good team action shot. A ball, eyes,  player names...definately fits the challenge guidelines. I liked the blurred spectator''s. Possibly a little more sharpening of the image could have been applied as the last step.</td>', 'This photo has everything it needs for a good team action shot. A ball, eyes,  player names...definately fits the challenge guidelines. I liked the blurred spectator''s. Possibly a little more sharpening of the image could have been applied as the last step.', '2004-09-17 05:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(914214, 105420, 26334, '<td valign="top">i like very much, but lack of shapness bro!</td>', 'i like very much, but lack of shapness bro!', '2004-09-17 05:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(914216, 104848, 26526, '<td valign="top">Very well done! I like the contrast.</td>', 'Very well done! I like the contrast.', '2004-09-17 05:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(914217, 105478, 23300, '<td valign="top">Great action shot. I almost feel like a part of the crowd. This shot portrays a sort of "intimacy" between players and spectators. All the red and white are somehow exciting and the similar actions of the players on this side add a lot of interest to the image.</td>', 'Great action shot. I almost feel like a part of the crowd. This shot portrays a sort of "intimacy" between players and spectators. All the red and white are somehow exciting and the similar actions of the players on this side add a lot of interest to the image.', '2004-09-17 05:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(914219, 104802, 26526, '<td valign="top">A different angle of whatever this sport is. I like the photo.</td>', 'A different angle of whatever this sport is. I like the photo.', '2004-09-17 05:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(914220, 105361, 26526, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Good photo also.</td>', 'Great shot! Good photo also.', '2004-09-17 05:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(914221, 105248, 23300, '<td valign="top">The "gritiness" of this image really appeals to me. It portrays a real sense of energy and enjoyment.</td>', 'The "gritiness" of this image really appeals to me. It portrays a real sense of energy and enjoyment.', '2004-09-17 05:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(914222, 104604, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like the action portrayed by this image. It does seem a liitle dark though.</td>', 'I like the action portrayed by this image. It does seem a liitle dark though.', '2004-09-17 05:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(914224, 105355, 26526, '<td valign="top">Good photo. Slightly out of focus. Could be my contact lens.</td>', 'Good photo. Slightly out of focus. Could be my contact lens.', '2004-09-17 05:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(914226, 104495, 23300, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I love the colour and the angle. The composition enhances the energy of the scene. Good Luck.<br/>P.S. What is he doing with his left hand?  :)</td>', 'Beautiful. I love the colour and the angle. The composition enhances the energy of the scene. Good Luck.P.S. What is he doing with his left hand?  :)', '2004-09-17 05:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(914228, 105414, 23300, '<td valign="top">This image portrays the energy of the scene well. I think it would benefit from being cropped tighter around the girls and having the contrast increased a little. Also the image is very small making it hard to see. Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'This image portrays the energy of the scene well. I think it would benefit from being cropped tighter around the girls and having the contrast increased a little. Also the image is very small making it hard to see. Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-17 06:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(914229, 105486, 26334, '<td valign="top">bro , just out of focus</td>', 'bro , just out of focus', '2004-09-17 06:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(914230, 105394, 26526, '<td valign="top">Cool photo! That is the strangest looking Pelican I have ever seen.</td>', 'Cool photo! That is the strangest looking Pelican I have ever seen.', '2004-09-17 06:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(914235, 104076, 23300, '<td valign="top">My first reaction is that cropping a little off the top and bottom and trying black and white or sepia would enhance the "loneliness" of this image. I don''t mean to pick, I just think that this image expresses a lot and that feeling could be "pushed" even further. Good Luck in the challenge.</td>', 'My first reaction is that cropping a little off the top and bottom and trying black and white or sepia would enhance the "loneliness" of this image. I don''t mean to pick, I just think that this image expresses a lot and that feeling could be "pushed" even further. Good Luck in the challenge.', '2004-09-17 06:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(914236, 105204, 26526, '<td valign="top">I see a ball, a hand. Where did the wings come from? I don''t "get it." Then again, I not an avid sport fan.</td>', 'I see a ball, a hand. Where did the wings come from? I don''t "get it." Then again, I not an avid sport fan.', '2004-09-17 06:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(914237, 105401, 23300, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. The soft colours work well too. This image portarys the energy of the scene well.</td>', 'Excellent composition. The soft colours work well too. This image portarys the energy of the scene well.', '2004-09-17 06:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(914238, 105162, 26526, '<td valign="top">Hopefully these are only his baby teeth, will fall out.  Humerous photo!</td>', 'Hopefully these are only his baby teeth, will fall out.  Humerous photo!', '2004-09-17 06:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(914239, 105239, 26334, '<td valign="top">grat shot.i it could be batter if the ball  sharp</td>', 'grat shot.i it could be batter if the ball  sharp', '2004-09-17 06:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(914240, 105442, 23300, '<td valign="top">I think the composition works well. The image is too small for me to see it really well.</td>', 'I think the composition works well. The image is too small for me to see it really well.', '2004-09-17 06:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(914244, 105308, 26334, '<td valign="top">what a artistic</td>', 'what a artistic', '2004-09-17 06:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(914245, 104741, 26526, '<td valign="top">Nice photo!  Great color and composition. Doesn''t fit team action. Enter it in the wrong challenge accidently?</td>', 'Nice photo!  Great color and composition. Doesn''t fit team action. Enter it in the wrong challenge accidently?', '2004-09-17 06:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(914248, 104491, 23300, '<td valign="top">Your cropping works well to enhance the action.</td>', 'Your cropping works well to enhance the action.', '2004-09-17 06:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
