(914892, 104827, 21183, '<td valign="top">Interesting how you managed to get the shadow of the ball and volleyball player''s hand above the netball net. Perfect title. A very thought provoking image.</td>', 'Interesting how you managed to get the shadow of the ball and volleyball player''s hand above the netball net. Perfect title. A very thought provoking image.', '2004-09-17 18:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
