(915607, 105379, 23394, '<td valign="top">great action shot!  this is one of the things i love about sports shooting...your there, your shooting like crazy.  every now and then, you know you got a killer shot, but you can''t stop shooting, because you know you''ll miss something.  then, once you finally start going through the 2-300 images you shot, you come back across the winner...way to go!  hope this does well for you.</td>', 'great action shot!  this is one of the things i love about sports shooting...your there, your shooting like crazy.  every now and then, you know you got a killer shot, but you can''t stop shooting, because you know you''ll miss something.  then, once you finally start going through the 2-300 images you shot, you come back across the winner...way to go!  hope this does well for you.', '2004-09-18 07:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(915608, 105237, 23394, '<td valign="top">too bad about the cropped foot...doesn''t that just kill you, when you know you have everything else perfect, absolutely perfect, and there''s that one detail you can''t correct.  this is one of my favorites for the challenge, and i hope it does well for you.</td>', 'too bad about the cropped foot...doesn''t that just kill you, when you know you have everything else perfect, absolutely perfect, and there''s that one detail you can''t correct.  this is one of my favorites for the challenge, and i hope it does well for you.', '2004-09-18 07:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
