(915614, 105239, 24128, '<td valign="top">Excellent pic, well done - the senerity of the sky and general scene combined with the knowledge of the nature of this sport make this pic simply sublime, certainly for me  this pic is the best of the contest - 10<br/>The only suggestion that I cam make is to ensure that there is a piece of good classical music playing while looking at this image, then close your eyes and imagine the impact of the scene as it would continue (in a raw black and white grainy kinda way, shot at a low frame rate)</td>', 'Excellent pic, well done - the senerity of the sky and general scene combined with the knowledge of the nature of this sport make this pic simply sublime, certainly for me  this pic is the best of the contest - 10The only suggestion that I cam make is to ensure that there is a piece of good classical music playing while looking at this image, then close your eyes and imagine the impact of the scene as it would continue (in a raw black and white grainy kinda way, shot at a low frame rate)', '2004-09-18 07:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
