(915618, 104980, 23394, '<td valign="top">while this is a good image, it could use a few things to make it a great one.  a higher shutter speed and a slightly smaller dof.  that will zero the focus in on the immediate action at hand.  you might also try shooting from a slightly lower angle; that tends to put the viewer on the field as opposed from being in the stands.  good luck, hope this does well for you.</td>', 'while this is a good image, it could use a few things to make it a great one.  a higher shutter speed and a slightly smaller dof.  that will zero the focus in on the immediate action at hand.  you might also try shooting from a slightly lower angle; that tends to put the viewer on the field as opposed from being in the stands.  good luck, hope this does well for you.', '2004-09-18 07:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
