(918770, 105433, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great colors and decent exposure.  Action isn''t a really strong point.  I think you lowered your score for some by saying it was a practice session.  There''s no way the viewer can tell - and he / she doesn''t really need to know that.</td>', 'Great colors and decent exposure.  Action isn''t a really strong point.  I think you lowered your score for some by saying it was a practice session.  There''s no way the viewer can tell - and he / she doesn''t really need to know that.', '2004-09-21 00:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
