(919862, 104741, 23394, '<td valign="top">the title says it all...nice landscape, though.  looks like a lovely place.  i''m sure you''d will never forget that magical morning when <br/>the sun slipped past the horizon''s grasp and whispered, <br/>"I''m here, you''re here, it''s a brand new day."<br/>the distant clouds, the foggy shrouds, the vision<br/>called and captured, sang, "I''m yours to take away."</td>', 'the title says it all...nice landscape, though.  looks like a lovely place.  i''m sure you''d will never forget that magical morning when the sun slipped past the horizon''s grasp and whispered, "I''m here, you''re here, it''s a brand new day."the distant clouds, the foggy shrouds, the visioncalled and captured, sang, "I''m yours to take away."', '2004-09-21 19:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
