(920027, 105255, 21714, '<td valign="top">This makes me wonder how many tries you had with the shot. It''s a very cool idea and I love the effect. Original work. Very well done. Best of luck.</td>', 'This makes me wonder how many tries you had with the shot. It''s a very cool idea and I love the effect. Original work. Very well done. Best of luck.', '2004-09-21 21:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(920031, 104829, 21714, '<td valign="top">Would have nice to see some fielders or the ampire somewhere. Also, those pots in the background aren''t every suited for Cricket.  <br/>It''s a good idea and the execution is good too. It''s the background and the kit he''s wearing that doesn''t give the idea of Cricket.</td>', 'Would have nice to see some fielders or the ampire somewhere. Also, those pots in the background aren''t every suited for Cricket.  It''s a good idea and the execution is good too. It''s the background and the kit he''s wearing that doesn''t give the idea of Cricket.', '2004-09-21 21:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(920042, 104848, 21714, '<td valign="top">For the title you have chosen to show that it''s a team sport, I think perhaps the moment the other swimmer takes over would have made it more believable. I am not saying this is someone having a morning swim. My point is, there''s no way to tell that this is a team event. Well, of course the title is there - but I think it''s the photograph that should tell the story.</td>', 'For the title you have chosen to show that it''s a team sport, I think perhaps the moment the other swimmer takes over would have made it more believable. I am not saying this is someone having a morning swim. My point is, there''s no way to tell that this is a team event. Well, of course the title is there - but I think it''s the photograph that should tell the story.', '2004-09-21 21:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(920043, 105438, 25218, '<td valign="top">made me laugh!</td>', 'made me laugh!', '2004-09-21 21:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(920044, 104116, 25218, '<td valign="top">It looks like the focus was on the camera man</td>', 'It looks like the focus was on the camera man', '2004-09-21 21:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(920046, 104410, 25218, '<td valign="top">great composition! nice deep colors. I''m usually not partial to borders, but this is really sets it - good work!</td>', 'great composition! nice deep colors. I''m usually not partial to borders, but this is really sets it - good work!', '2004-09-21 21:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(920049, 105260, 25218, '<td valign="top">great action shot, but cropping more on the action would have made it more focused - the guy on the ground is distracting</td>', 'great action shot, but cropping more on the action would have made it more focused - the guy on the ground is distracting', '2004-09-21 21:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(920051, 104730, 21714, '<td valign="top">There''s nothing in this image to indicate it''s a team event. It''s a swimmer for sure - but he could well be a morning swim. It could have been captured during a team event, but this image does not show it. <br/>My point is, at least another swimmer taking over or looking on would have given the idea that there''s a team here working together. Then you can argue that swimming can be a team sport - well, anything can be a team sport, but you have to show  that it is.</td>', 'There''s nothing in this image to indicate it''s a team event. It''s a swimmer for sure - but he could well be a morning swim. It could have been captured during a team event, but this image does not show it. My point is, at least another swimmer taking over or looking on would have given the idea that there''s a team here working together. Then you can argue that swimming can be a team sport - well, anything can be a team sport, but you have to show  that it is.', '2004-09-21 21:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(920053, 104295, 25218, '<td valign="top">Clever title &amp; great composition! I like the blur of the tip of the net - it really emphasizes the action.</td>', 'Clever title & great composition! I like the blur of the tip of the net - it really emphasizes the action.', '2004-09-21 21:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(920064, 105162, 25218, '<td valign="top">great use of foreshortening, but the teeth are a little over the top. otherwise the photo looks great</td>', 'great use of foreshortening, but the teeth are a little over the top. otherwise the photo looks great', '2004-09-21 21:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(920071, 105401, 21714, '<td valign="top">I love thhe detail in this image. It''s a clean neat image showing real action. Love the way he''s looking ahead really focussed and determined.  Something I really like about is the chin of the guy behind - looks like a shark attack.  This is my favourite. 10</td>', 'I love thhe detail in this image. It''s a clean neat image showing real action. Love the way he''s looking ahead really focussed and determined.  Something I really like about is the chin of the guy behind - looks like a shark attack.  This is my favourite. 10', '2004-09-21 21:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(920072, 104829, 25218, '<td valign="top">my first inclination was to dismiss it as "too blurry, I don''t like the focus on the ball", but the more I study it, the more I like it.</td>', 'my first inclination was to dismiss it as "too blurry, I don''t like the focus on the ball", but the more I study it, the more I like it.', '2004-09-21 21:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(920073, 104802, 21714, '<td valign="top">What a composition!!! Excellent. The only thing that puts me off is the sharpening - or rather the over sharpening. I hate halos! But this is a brilliant capture and I love this composition.  One of my favourites for a ribbon. 10</td>', 'What a composition!!! Excellent. The only thing that puts me off is the sharpening - or rather the over sharpening. I hate halos! But this is a brilliant capture and I love this composition.  One of my favourites for a ribbon. 10', '2004-09-21 21:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
