(920166, 104771, 24896, '<td valign="top">excellent try on this pic...I like the motion in the player but the trail of the ball is very faint...I''m guessing you wanted the effect of a fast shot. This would have been awesome if you could see a little more of the balls path and then the goalie moving too and missing the save. I liked this alot.</td>', 'excellent try on this pic...I like the motion in the player but the trail of the ball is very faint...I''m guessing you wanted the effect of a fast shot. This would have been awesome if you could see a little more of the balls path and then the goalie moving too and missing the save. I liked this alot.', '2004-09-21 22:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(920202, 104937, 16301, '<td valign="top">Go team pelican!</td>', 'Go team pelican!', '2004-09-21 22:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
