(920290, 105486, 22313, '<td valign="top">Pretty good shot, too bad the player in white had to get in the way of the player scoring the goal.</td>', 'Pretty good shot, too bad the player in white had to get in the way of the player scoring the goal.', '2004-09-22 00:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(920299, 104209, 26835, '<td valign="top">Very Nice<br/></td>', 'Very Nice', '2004-09-22 00:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(920304, 105035, 21643, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I love how the facial expressions are a prominent part of the photo. It feels like there''s too much space at the bottom of the shot and not enough at the top, but it''s hard to fault you for not positioning things just right in an action shot like this one. Might look a little less off-center, though, if you crop a bit of the bottom off? At any rate, you did a great job capturing the moment!</td>', 'Great shot. I love how the facial expressions are a prominent part of the photo. It feels like there''s too much space at the bottom of the shot and not enough at the top, but it''s hard to fault you for not positioning things just right in an action shot like this one. Might look a little less off-center, though, if you crop a bit of the bottom off? At any rate, you did a great job capturing the moment!', '2004-09-22 00:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(920309, 104689, 21643, '<td valign="top">After all the photos of kids'' soccer and college sports, this photo''s really refreshing because of its unique subject matter. Points for creativity. Thanks!</td>', 'After all the photos of kids'' soccer and college sports, this photo''s really refreshing because of its unique subject matter. Points for creativity. Thanks!', '2004-09-22 00:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(920310, 104209, 24976, '<td valign="top">the picture is beautiful but i wish that more of the face were visible (with the highliight on the arm and the visibility of the chest it seems that there is a mask on the face) and the right leg a bit more defined.... But other than that i really love everything else about the picture, including the pose, the shadow, the ball, the sea dn the use of lines running in the near background and converging at the place the figure is. Very nicely done. 9</td>', 'the picture is beautiful but i wish that more of the face were visible (with the highliight on the arm and the visibility of the chest it seems that there is a mask on the face) and the right leg a bit more defined.... But other than that i really love everything else about the picture, including the pose, the shadow, the ball, the sea dn the use of lines running in the near background and converging at the place the figure is. Very nicely done. 9', '2004-09-22 00:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(920318, 104557, 23680, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this shot, but I don''t like the colors</td>', 'I like the idea of this shot, but I don''t like the colors', '2004-09-22 00:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
