(921507, 104076, 18667, '<td valign="top">I do not agree at all with comments below that say ''what is this trying to convey?  I don''t see it...''<br/> <br/>It is most likely because I played many years as a goalkeeper, but I think this image is better than what it placed.  For those that have been in the spot depicted in the image, the feeling and emotion there is well seen and felt.<br/> <br/>I will say that the image itself is very well done, the only drawback is the frame of the goal being cut off on the left side of the image.  Including the whole structure would have improved it.  Not much more than that to improve on!</td>', 'I do not agree at all with comments below that say ''what is this trying to convey?  I don''t see it...'' It is most likely because I played many years as a goalkeeper, but I think this image is better than what it placed.  For those that have been in the spot depicted in the image, the feeling and emotion there is well seen and felt. I will say that the image itself is very well done, the only drawback is the frame of the goal being cut off on the left side of the image.  Including the whole structure would have improved it.  Not much more than that to improve on!', '2004-09-22 14:05:12.000000', NULL, 0),
