(922865, 105255, 21124, '<td valign="top">Now that I read your comment, I think that I can see the clear tape.<br/> <br/>Regarding your photo, it seems a little noisy on the green background.<br/>As I also have a c750 I know that it is quite noisy with "long" exposures. I think that you could have improved the quality of the picture by enabling the noise reduction of the camera. It works for me for shoots &gt;= 1s.</td>', 'Now that I read your comment, I think that I can see the clear tape. Regarding your photo, it seems a little noisy on the green background.As I also have a c750 I know that it is quite noisy with "long" exposures. I think that you could have improved the quality of the picture by enabling the noise reduction of the camera. It works for me for shoots >= 1s.', '2004-09-23 02:40:56.000000', NULL, 0),
