(925875, 104887, 16230, '<td valign="top">I like your bio statement, "Tear my photos apart, I''ll do it to others." I think that''s a good attitude to have around here.<br/> <br/>Well, I finally got a chance to look at this photo on my Nokia monitor. Although the colors do look a little brighter on this monitor, I still think they look a little subdued. Just for the heck of it, I opened the image into Photoshop and ran Auto Contrast on it. I think the result gave it a bit more pop.<br/> <br/>I''m sorry I didn''t get a chance to give this a second look during the voting. I gave it an 8, and probably would have bumped it to a 9 or 10.<br/> <br/>Anyway, congratulations on your top-ten finish. Great photo!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I like your bio statement, "Tear my photos apart, I''ll do it to others." I think that''s a good attitude to have around here. Well, I finally got a chance to look at this photo on my Nokia monitor. Although the colors do look a little brighter on this monitor, I still think they look a little subdued. Just for the heck of it, I opened the image into Photoshop and ran Auto Contrast on it. I think the result gave it a bit more pop. I''m sorry I didn''t get a chance to give this a second look during the voting. I gave it an 8, and probably would have bumped it to a 9 or 10. Anyway, congratulations on your top-ten finish. Great photo! ', '2004-09-25 12:41:31.000000', NULL, 0),
