(937920, 104887, 12962, '<td valign="top">Sorry, my prediction didn''t come true.  It really could have been higher but top ten is not bad. But look at it that way, 24 people gave this a ten, certainly far more than the others in the top ten column received (except the blue).   And looking at your scores so far ... you''re showing a lot of improvement ... a ribbon is not far away.  Hope to see more of your work!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-03 01:26:30.</i></td>', 'Sorry, my prediction didn''t come true.  It really could have been higher but top ten is not bad. But look at it that way, 24 people gave this a ten, certainly far more than the others in the top ten column received (except the blue).   And looking at your scores so far ... you''re showing a lot of improvement ... a ribbon is not far away.  Hope to see more of your work!', '2004-10-03 02:21:41.000000', '2004-10-03 02:26:30.000000', 0),
