(961529, 105267, 26246, '<td valign="top">It was the last point of the final game. Annual summer bocce game that take place in Belnome, Piacenza in north west Italy. A village with 50 people during the summer and none during the rest of the year.<br/>There was really quite whole village there.<br/>I do agree: with balls on the ground the shoot could be better but I preferred to focus on the wait of the people.<br/>Thank you all.<br/>Cià.</td>', 'It was the last point of the final game. Annual summer bocce game that take place in Belnome, Piacenza in north west Italy. A village with 50 people during the summer and none during the rest of the year.There was really quite whole village there.I do agree: with balls on the ground the shoot could be better but I preferred to focus on the wait of the people.Thank you all.Cià.', '2004-10-16 09:28:10.000000', NULL, 0),
